    Finally, using the identification between the vertices of $Q$ and the elements of $\Zbb^2$, we see that equivalence classes of words in $\kbb Q/J$ correspond to spread curves, so that string modules in $\rep(Q,J)$ correspond, under~$F$, to spread curve representations.
