\subsection{Classifying band representations of $R$}

Towards the goal of providing a classification of the band representations of $R$,
we first provide a correspondence between $\Zbb$-words in $R$ and oriented cycles in the direct graph $S$ of \cref{figure:large-gentle-quiver}.
The idea of characterizing words in a string algebra using oriented paths in an associated oriented graph that is obtained by changing some orientations appears in, e.g., \cite{bell-et-al}.

