Analogously, $f_{1}^U$ maps to $f_{-;1,3}^A(1+e_{2}^Af_{2}^A)-f_{1}^Af_{2}^A(2+e_{2}^Af_{2}^A)$. Applying the cups and caps, and converting the remaining $f_2^U$ to $e_2^A$, we get
