    For a finitary functor $F$ with levelwise dualizable derivatives, there is a natural equivalence
    \[\partial_\ast (F) \simeq K(\partial^\ast (F)).\]
For $c\in C$, the layers of the filtered map \[P_\ast(F)(c) \rightarrow P_\ast^\mathrm{fake}(F)(c)\]
