    The category $\s$ is not differentially $1$-semiadditive. There is an equivalence \[\partial_\ast \Sigma^\infty R_{\bb{S}} \simeq \mathrm{com},\] and these Tate constructions are the ``extended powers'' and are generally nontrivial.
