r a polite tone, clarity, and engaging. If responses are too aggressive or too complicated, they might push users away instead of helping them understand the truth \citep{mathew2019thou, wang2024intent}. These limitations show us that we need a better way to fight health misinformation. We need a more trustworthy and reliable approach that integrates multiple retrieval strategies, includes real-time evidence, and structures response generation, which will enhance the user reliability on counterspeech. 



