Our contributions in this study include:
\begin{itemize}
\item \textbf{Multi-Agent Retrieval-Augmented Framework}
\newline We propose a multi-agent pipeline that integrates a designed retrieval and generation module to realize effective counterspeech generation. Our method outperforms across all evaluation dimensions (Politeness (0.88), and Informativeness (0.78) while maintaining strong Relevance (0.70) and Factual Accuracy (0.86)).
\item \textbf{Evidence Enhancement and Refined Response Generation} 
\newline Our system integrates static retrieval and dynamic retrieval to gather reliable and updated evidence, ensuring robust support for countering health misinformation. Additionally, our refinement agent makes counterspeech more accessible, leading to higher human preference in our evaluation.

\end{itemize}


