% The term \(\text{cos}(E(Q), E(R_i))\) epresents the semantic similarity calculated using word embeddings. The parameter \(\lambda\) is a hyperparameter that helps to balance the importance of keyword matching and semantic relevance. Finally, we select the top evidence pieces from the \(R_{combined}\) based on based on these scores for further summarization: \(R_{filtered} = \text{Top-N}(R_{combined})\).

