\subsection{Two-step Spatio-Temporal Token Compression}
\label{sec: two-step}
% Attempt to simultaneously compress video tokens in both temporal and spatial dimensions are not uncommon in the MLLMs field. Common approaches include using temporal segmentation to divide the video, merging adjacent frames with high similarity, compressing over time at certain anchored spatial positions, etc. However, these approaches overlook the fact that semantically identical regions are not necessarily adjacent in time or space.
% 尝试同时在时空维度对video token进行压缩在MLLMs领域并不罕见，常见的方法包括使用temporal segmentation切分视频；合并相邻的相似度高的帧；对某一锚定的空间位置在时序上进行压缩等，然而，这些方法都忽视了一个事实，语义相同的区域并不一定在时间或空间上相邻。
Equipped with the SCC strategy, we further propose a two-step token compression strategy across both spatial and temporal dimensions.
% Since SCC 策略提供了一种 aim to capture distinct semantic regions 
Given a video $\mathbf{V} = \{\mathbf{v}_1, ..., \mathbf{v}_n\}$ consisting of $n$ frames, the visual video tokens $\mathbf{T} = \{\mathbf{t}_1, ..., \mathbf{t}_n\} \in \mathbb{R}^{n\times m\times d}$ can be derived by processing it through the visual encoder and the visual projector, where $m$ denotes the number of tokens per frame and $d$ is the hidden state size. 
We first  determine the representative tokens for each frame in the spatial dimension. For each frame $ \mathbf{t}_i \in \mathbf{T} $ containing $ m'_i $ independent semantic regions, we use $ \mathbf{t}'_i $ to denote the representative tokens obtained through the SCC strategy. 
% We 首先考虑在空间维度上确定每一帧的representive tokens，对于包含$m'_i$个独立语义区域的每一帧$t_i$，我们用t'_i \in \mathbb{R}^{m'_i \times c} 表示经由SCC策略得到的代表性token。
\begin{equation}
    \mathbf{t}'_i = \text{SCC} ( \mathbf{t}_i) \in \mathbb{R}^{m'_i \times d}, i= 1, ..., n.
\end{equation}
%After the first step of spatial fusion, we obtain the representative token for every frame in the video. 之后，我们把这n个t'_i concat起来，以便进一步考虑这些语义区域在时序上的相似性。
After spatial compression, we obtain the representative tokens for every frame in the video. Subsequently, we concatenate all $ t'_i $ together to further consider 
% the similarity of these semantic regions across the temporal sequence.
the redundancy temporally.
\begin{equation}
    \mathbf{T}' = \text{concat}[\mathbf{t}'_1, ..., \mathbf{t}'_n] \in \mathbb{R}^{M'\times d}; M' = \sum_{i=1}^{n}m'_i .
\end{equation}
% 在T'中，包含了视频每一帧的全部代表性token。然而，在每一帧空间上distinct的semantic region仍然share相似的语义区域。因此，为了尽可能avoid redundancy，similar to spatial fusion, 我们在时序上再次使用SCC策略以进一步在时序上合并相似的代表性token。
In $ \mathbf{T}' $, all representative tokens from each frame of the video are included. However, distinct semantic regions within the spatial dimension of each frame may still share overlaps across frames. That is semantic regions appearing in one frame may also appear in other frames. Therefore, to avoid redundancy as much as possible, similar to spatial fusion, we apply the SCC strategy again temporally to further compress similar representative tokens across the sequence:
$\mathbf{T^r} = \text{SCC} ( \mathbf{T'}) \in \mathbb{R}^{M \times d}.$
% 通过两次使用SCC策略，能够代表整个视频中所有unique semantic region的representative tokens can be obtained。Treating them as the retrained tokens, we further apply the ToMe~\cite{bolya2022tome} approach  为所有token选择最合适的语义区域。 
% By employing the SCC strategy,
The representative tokens $\mathbf{T^r}$ comprehensively cover all spatio-temporally distinct semantic regions without redundancy or overlap. Treating them as retained tokens, we select the most suitable semantic regions for all tokens inspired by ToMe~\cite{bolya2022tome}.

% Specifically, 我们将全部token $T^{all} = \text{concat}[t_1, ..., t_n] \in \mathbb{R}^{(n\cdot m)\times c}$视为源token，将保留下来的token $T_{r}$ 视为目标token。 As shown in Eqn. (4),我们首先计算其相似度map，并为$T^{all}$中的每一个token$t^{a}_i$都找到与其最相似的目标$T^{r}$中的token$t^{r}_j$，并将索引存储在$I$中。
Specifically, we consider all tokens $ \mathbf{T^{a}} = \text{concat}[\mathbf{t}_1, ..., \mathbf{t}_n] \in \mathbb{R}^{(n\cdot m)\times d} $ as the source tokens, and the retained tokens $ \mathbf{T^{r}} $ as the target tokens. As shown in \eqnref{tome sim}, we first compute the similarity map and find the most similar token $ \mathbf{t}^{\mathbf{r}}_j $ in $ \mathbf{T^{r}} $ for each token $ \mathbf{t}^{\mathbf{a}}_i $ in $ \mathbf{T^{a}} $, storing the indices in $ I $.
\begin{equation}
\label{tome sim}
\begin{aligned}
     \mathcal{S} = \frac{ \mathbf{T^{a}}  \cdot (\mathbf{T^{r}})^{\top}}{||\mathbf{T^{a}}||\cdot ||\mathbf{T^{r}}||} \in \mathbb{R}^{(n\cdot m) \times M};
     I = \text{argmax}_{i\in M} \mathcal{S}(i) \in\mathbb{R}^{(n\cdot m)}.   
\end{aligned}
\end{equation}
% $I$是一个长度为$n\cdot m$的向量，保存了$T^{all}$中的每一个token对应的最相似目标token的索引。具体来说，$I_i = j$表示$T^a_i$最接近$t^r_j$. Finally，对于每个$t^r{j} \in T^r$，我们收集所有标记为$j$的token$t^a_i \in T^{all}$,并将其与$t^{r}_j$进行加权合并，得到最终的合并后的token$t^{fin}_j$。
$ I $ is a vector that stores the index of the most similar target token in $\mathbf{T^r}$ for each token in $ \mathbf{T^{a}} $. Specifically, $ I_i = j $ indicates that $ \mathbf{t}^\mathbf{a}_i $ is closest to $ \mathbf{t}^\mathbf{r}_j $. Finally, for each source token $ \mathbf{t}^\mathbf{a}_i \in \mathbf{T^{a}} $, we assign it to the most similar target token $ \mathbf{t}^\mathbf{r}_j \in \mathbf{T^r} $ according to $I$ and perform an average merge to obtain the final compressed token $ \mathbf{t}^{\mathbf{fin}}_j $.
\begin{equation}
    \mathbf{t}^{\mathbf{fin}}_j = \frac{ \sum^{n\cdot m}_{i=1} \mathbf{t}^\mathbf{a}_i \mathbbm{1}(I_i = j) + \mathbf{t}^{\mathbf{r}}_j }{\sum^{n\cdot m}_{i=1} \mathbbm{1}(I_i = j) + 1}, j = 1, ..., M.
\end{equation}
% Thus, 我们得到了最终的融合后的token$T^{fin} = \text{concat}[t^{fin}_1, ..., t^{fin}_{M'}]$用来表示整段视频。这组token以视频中出现的所有跨时空不重叠的独立语义区域为锚点，并将全部token融合进来，最终实现了token数量从$N$到$M'$的压缩。
We obtain the final merged tokens $ \mathbf{T}^{\mathbf{fin}} = \text{concat}[\mathbf{t}^{\mathbf{fin}}_1, ..., \mathbf{t}^{\mathbf{fin}}_{M}] \in \mathbb{R}^{M\times d} $ to represent the entire video. 
% This set of tokens serves as anchors for all spatio-temporal distinct semantic regions appearing in the video, integrating all tokens together, and ultimately achieving a compression of the token count from $ N $ to $ M $.



\section{Experiments}
\subsection{Experiment Setup}
\label{sec: setup}
\myPara{Implement details.}
% 与之前的很多方法类似，我们选择了LLaVA-OneVision作为基础模型架构，其基础模型使用了CLIP Encoder和Qwen 2作为LLM。然而，考虑随着MLLM的快速发展，其架构和性能已经不是最领先的了，例如SIGLIP在很多方法中被认为是更好的视觉encoder。因此，我们使用SIGLIP替换了原始模型中的视觉encoder，并使用了更先进Qwen 2.5作为LLM模型，使用Oryx数据重新训练了一个增强后的LLaVA-OneVision模型。
Similar to previous approaches, we choose LLaVA-OneVision~\cite{li2024llavaone} as the base model architecture, which originally utilizes the CLIP~\cite{radford2021clip} as the visual encoder and Qwen 2~\cite{qwen2} as the LLM. However, considering the rapid advancements in MLLM, its architecture and performance are no longer the most cutting-edge. For instance, SIGLIP (so400m-patch14-384)~\cite{zhai2023sigmoid} is regarded as a superior vision encoder in many methods~\cite{apollo}. Therefore, we replace the vision encoder in the original model with SIGLIP, employ the more advanced Qwen 2.5~\cite{qwen2.5} as the LLM, and retrain an enhanced version of the LLaVA-OneVision model using open-sourced Oryx~\cite{liu2024oryx} data.

% Equipped with enhanced LLaVA-OneVision model, 我们实现了proposed method and compare with other approaches upon it. 我们主要通过similarity threshold tau来控制retention ratio，如果没有额外说明，我们设置eplison为0.05.将本文中的所有实验都 are performed on 1 NVIDIA A100 GPU。 
Equipped with the enhanced LLaVA-OneVision model, we implement the proposed method and compare it with other approaches based on this model for a fair comparison. We primarily control the retention ratio through the similarity threshold $\tau$. Unless otherwise specified, we set $\epsilon$ to 0.05. All evaluation experiments in this paper are conducted on a single NVIDIA A100 GPU.

\myPara{Benchmarks and compared approaches.}
% 我们在Video Question-Answering Benchmarks (ActivityNet, Video-ChatGPT, Next-QA), Long Video Benchmarks (Egoschema, MLVU, VideoMME, VideoMMMU) and 综合 Multi-choice benchmark MVBench 上验证了\MyMthd{}的有效性。 我们对比的方法包括Image-based 压缩策略VisionZip, Pooling-based method PLLaVA, prefilling阶段压缩策略FastV and 在时序和decode阶段同时压缩的DyCoke. Notably, 与论文中的基础设置一致，we set the dominant token 和 contextual token的比例为5.4 for VisionZip;  The attention computation layer for FastV and DyCoke is set to layer 3.
We validate the effectiveness of \MyMthd{} on a variety of benchmarks, including Video Question-Answering Benchmarks (ActivityNet-QA~\cite{yu2019activityqa}, Video-ChatGPT~\cite{Maaz2023VideoChatGPT}, Next-QA~\cite{xiao2021next}), Long Video Benchmarks (Egoschema~\cite{mangalam2023egoschema}, MLVU~\cite{MLVU}, Video-MME~\cite{fu2024videomme}, VideoMMMU~\cite{hu2025videommmu}), and the comprehensive multi-choice benchmark MVBench~\cite{li2024mvbench}. A detailed introduction to each dataset is provided in \secref{sec: benchmarks} of appendix.
% 详细的对每个数据集的介绍在\secref{sec: benchmarks}中。

We compare against several open-source representative methods: the image-based compression strategy VisionZip~\cite{yang2024visionzip}, the pooling-based PLLaVA~\cite{xu2024pllava}, the pre-filling compression method FastV~\cite{chen2024image}, and DyCoke~\cite{tao2024dycoke}, which applies compression in both the temporal and decoding stages. Notably, following the original paper settings, the ratio of dominant to contextual tokens in VisionZip is set to 5.4; the attention computation layer for both FastV and DyCoke is set to layer 3.



