\noindent \textbf{\ding{173} Untrusted Inference Execution.}
During \infer, \task sends inference queries (i.e., sample IDs) to \data, which executes the full model locally and returns untrusted predictions.
This execution path corresponds to the high-performance, non-instrumented inference module.
Since \data retains full control over this component, its execution cannot be directly verified and is thus considered potentially vulnerable.
