\noindent \textbf{\ding{174} Inference Auditing via TEE-COO Trusted Path.}
In parallel, \method triggers a confidential inference auditing by selecting a randomized subset of inputs for validation (details in Sec.~\ref{subsec:efficiency_schedule}).
These inputs are passed through a secure inference pipeline that invokes two validated modules (details in Sec.~\ref{subsec:authenticity}): a data integrity checker that verifies the consistency of runtime inputs against pre-approved hash values, and a model integrity checker that verifies the authenticity of deployed model weights.
Upon successful validation, inference proceeds via the trusted pipeline, combining secure TEE-based shallow computation on \data and outsourced deep model execution on \coord.
\coord returns the trusted outputs to \task.
