    \item \textbf{Cross-modal attention} dynamically weighted affective signals 3.2× higher than behavioral features for students expressing academic distress
    \item \textbf{Focal loss ($\gamma=2$)} improved minority class (Drop-out) recall by 18\% while maintaining precision
